# Smart City Booking Admin UI

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Key points:

- Vue 2.7 + Vuetify 2 SPA, multi-tenant booking administration (Admin UI only)
- Backend API → github.com/ECCdigital/smart-city-booking-backend, Storefront → github.com/ECCdigital/smart-city-booking-store-front
- API calls via `src/services/api/`, permissions via `src/services/permissions/`, state in `src/store/`
- English for code, comments, commits, PRs, and changelog entries; German UI strings in `src/language/de/translations.json`
- DRY: reuse existing code; extract shared logic only on real duplication
- Run `npm run lint:check` before finishing
- Minimal diffs, no drive-by refactors, no commits unless asked
- Never commit secrets (`.env`)

Detailed guides: `docs/agents/`
